    "Your Partner for End-to-End Solutions",
    "Overview",
    "End-to-End Solutions",
    "System Design Solutions",
    "Resources",
    "Unlock the full potential of your silicon innovation with Synopsys System Solutions Group (SSG) Design Services. Our world-class team collaborates with you to transform ambitious ideas into market-leading SoC and subsystem solutions\u2014quickly and reliably.\u200b",
    "From architecture and microarchitecture to verification, power optimization, and turnkey implementation, SSG provides comprehensive expertise at every stage of the design journey. With a proven track record of first-pass silicon success and deep collaboration across these semiconductor ecosystem, we accelerate your time-to-market while minimizing risk.\u200b",
    "Whether you require specialized consulting or end-to-end design execution, Synopsys SSG empowers you to achieve breakthrough performance and differentiation in AI, automotive, high-performance computing, and beyond. Partner with us to turn your vision into silicon reality. \u200b",
    "Alongside, FirsPass Engineering, a subsidiary of SSG, is an accredited DMEA (Defense Microelectronics Activity) trusted supplier to the U.S. Department of Defense.",
    "New system architectures introduce new challenges in hardware/software partitioning and microarchitecture optimization. HPC, AI, and automotive segments are particularly dynamic markets where complex SoC development is getting more complex. Tight correlation between front-end design, implementation and package design are critical and require accurate performance and power modeling to meet product specifications. We offer flexible engagement models including turnkey SoC, subsystem block level and anything and everything between Spec-to-GDSII. We work closely with you to scale quality resourcing specific to your design needs.",
    "Synopsys offers a range of complete solutions to enhance performance and energy efficiency for Arm-based SoCs, focusing on improved methodologies for optimal power, performance, and area (PPA). Our offerings include fast system verification and ensure IP interoperability, along with robust verification and validation solutions. Specifically designed to work seamlessly with Arm Compute Subsystems (CSS), our silicon-proven IP portfolio, comprehensive SoC prototyping tools, and AI-driven verification solutions collectively support the development of high-performance systems. Synopsys leverages Arm Total Design by integrating its comprehensive suite of design tools and solutions with Arm's architecture and intellectual property. This collaboration enhances the design and development process for Arm-based SoCs.",
    "Advanced technology nodes make flow development an inevitable part of a design process. Our design methodology and flow deployment experts can help to optimize your existing flow, implement new sub-flows, or deploy a new one if needed. Our consultants have reduced months off flow-development with the LynxNXT Automation System, Synopsys\u2019 tool automation, project reporting, and flow environment.",
    "FirstPass Engineering provides clients with superior quality, responsive IC design services, and flexible engagement models from architecture or product specification development to full turnkey designs. FirstPass is a trusted partner for nearly 30 years, supporting clients in Aerospace & Defense as well as Federal, by providing secure and safe support for DMEA-sanctioned and Department of Defense (DoD) SoC and FPEG designs.",
    "Synopsys has built bleeding edge solutions through years of collaboration with foundry ecosystems, leading 3rd party IP providers and EDA partners. Today, we continue to expand our Solution ecosystem to support companies looking to take more control over their supply chain from SoC development to volume production.",
    "Customer success requires the right level of partnership, first pass silicon success and supply chain ecosystems to get into volume production. That\u2019s why our customer satisfaction rating excels across a broad range of application segments, process nodes, emerging technologies and business models.",
    "Top-notch program and technical management are a critical key to success on complex SoCs, and Synopsys certified Program Management ensure close/transparent collaboration with Synopsys, customer and all involved parties to deliver a successful on-time SoC project.",
    "Need help with your latest project?",
